  "cards": [
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "The immutability core (why agent_versions is huge)", "items": ["agent_versions is the frozen VersionSnapshot the runtime reads — invoke() never touches a live agents row", "snapshot_hash folds model_config + prompt_hash + retrieval_config + kb_index_version + skill_content_hash; a stale hash would bypass the eval cache/gate", "publishable is set TRUE only by a PASS eval; any DRIFT_TRIGGER edit flips it FALSE (spec B5)", "profile_snapshot freezes the capability profile so a pricing/feature change can't silently alter a published agent"] },
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Frontend features → tables", "items": ["agents/new + agents/[id] hub ↔ agents · agent_versions (data.ts Agent, Version)", "knowledge/* ↔ knowledge_bases · data_sources · documents · chunks (pgvector) · retrieval_bindings (DataSource, KnowledgeBase)", "skills/* ↔ skills · skill_resources · skill_bindings (Skill, SkillResource; signed at publish)", "evaluations + agents/[id] Evals tab ↔ eval_suites · eval_cases · eval_baselines · eval_runs · eval_results (EvalRun, EvalSuite, EvalCaseDef)"] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Modeling rules", "items": ["Every table carries workspace_id uuid not null (the RLS tenancy key): the four domain-root tables (agents, knowledge_bases, skills, eval_suites) draw the → workspaces line; child tables show it as an fk badge to cut noise", "Money is numeric(12,6) USD; tokens are integer; timestamps are timestamptz (UTC)", "chunks.embedding is vector(3072), HNSW-indexed via halfvec cast, namespaced per (workspace_id, kb_id)", "*_bindings and eval_* are version-scoped snapshots — they pin agent_versions.id, not the live agent"] },
    { "dot": "slate", "title": "Source & scope", "items": ["docs/backend/01-data-model.md §4 (DDL) · §6 (RLS) · spec.md A0/B2/B5 (completeness, version pinning, eval triggers)", "Part 1 of 2 — tools/MCP, publish/runs/observability, jobs/audit/quotas, adoption & notifications follow in Part 2", "Cross-part FKs (tool_bindings, published_endpoints, runs, eval_baselines→version) all re-anchor on agent_versions"] }
  ]
}
